@startuml tb-adapter
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Lucida Grande"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFCE
  BorderColor #000000
  BorderThickness 1
  ArrowColor #000000
  FontColor #000000
  AttributeFontColor #000000
  StereotypeFontColor #000000
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFCE
}
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

title 교과서 대응 — Adapter (Skypass 외부 API) (iteration 4)
class PaymentController <<Client>> {
}
interface SkypassInterface <<Target>> #line:red;line.bold {
  +getMileageBalance(no): int
  +deductMileage(no, amt): boolean
}
class SkypassAdapter <<Adapter>> #line:red;line.bold {
  -adaptee: RemoteSkypassApi
  --
  +getMileageBalance(no): int
  +deductMileage(no, amt): boolean
}
class RemoteSkypassApi <<Adaptee>> #line:red;line.bold {
  +getMileage(no): Map
  +postDeduct(no, amt): Map
}
PaymentController --> SkypassInterface
SkypassInterface <|.. SkypassAdapter
SkypassAdapter --> RemoteSkypassApi : -adaptee
note bottom of SkypassAdapter
  Adapter 가 Target(request) 을 구현하고 내부에서 Adaptee(specificRequest) 로 위임
end note
legend bottom
  <#FFFFCE>|= 표기 |= 의미 |
  |<#FFFFCE> 노란 박스 | iteration 1-3 기존 |
  | <color:red>빨강 테두리/글자</color> | iteration 4 신규/수정 |
endlegend
@enduml